Bedstead

The teletext character shapes (bbc/src/commonMain/kotlin/beebslop/bbc/
TeletextFont.kt) are generated from bedstead.c in
Bedstead 3.261 (https://bjh21.me.uk/bedstead/), by Ben Harris, Simon Tatham,
Marnanel Thurman and Neil Williamson, who dedicated it to the public domain
under CC0 1.0 (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt). The shapes are those of the Mullard
SAA5050; see LICENSES/LicenseRef-CDPA-s55.txt.

